      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "In episode two of The Naked Director, Toru Muranishi and Toshi scramble to raise startup cash in Sapporo. Inside a small loan office, Muranishi puts up the deed to his house and stamps his personal seal before stepping outside to compare totals with Toshi. Let's hear the Japanese dialogue first without worrying about catching every word.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "はい、自宅の権利書です。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "tencho",
      "t": "うちで五十万融通しますよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "どうも。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "tencho",
      "t": "利子は十日で一割です。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "tencho",
      "t": "いろいろ契約のことが書いてあります。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "構いません。はい、実印です。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "tencho",
      "t": "じゃ、押させてもらいますよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "よろしくお願いします。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
